  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>New capabilities in Form Recognizer - extract data from invoices and extract complex tables from documents using our most advanced deep learning models. In addition, the new version supports Japanese and enables you to easily get started via a <a href=\"https://fott-preview.azurewebsites.net/layout-analyze\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Form Recognizer Sample Tool</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/form-recognizer/quickstarts/client-library?tabs=ga&amp;pivots=programming-language-csharp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">client libraries</a> or <a href=\"https://westcentralus.dev.cognitive.microsoft.com/docs/services/form-recognizer-api-v2-1-preview-2/operations/AnalyzeBusinessCardAsync\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">REST API</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>See <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/form-recognizer/whats-new\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">what&rsquo;s new here</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "New capabilities in Form Recognizer - extract data from invoices and extract complex tables from documents using our most advanced deep learning models. In addition, the new version supports Japanese and enables you to easily get started via a Form Recognizer Sample Tool , client libraries or REST API .\n\nSee what’s new here ."
  },
